Z||000046||filthyscarecrow||08-03-2001||12:53 AM||||here's mine.... <P>1. the reverend horton heat- baddest of the bad (this is basically old school chase music. can't go wrong.)<BR>2. bush- everything zen<BR>3. police- wrapped around your finger (my dad used to play that tape when i was little and he took me for rides in the 84SE)<BR>4. live- white, discussion<BR>5. they might be giants- the famous polka (if you thought the looks you got from beethoven's 5th were weird, try this gem. besides, these guys are and always will be my favorite band.)<P>i love offspring and nirvana too though. i just couldn't fit them into the driving experience...<BR>||||reg||1
